## 2. Phase 1 prerequisites — Platform shell frame

**Goal:** Replace inline `app/me/layout.tsx` nav with platform shell landmarks; registration stays minimal shell.

| ID | Prerequisite | Evidence |
| -- | ------------ | -------- |
| P1-01 | GP-01, GP-02 complete | Sign-off record |
| P1-02 | DL-01, DL-02, DL-27 signed | Decision log |
| P1-03 | Shell CSS hooks: `[data-portal-shell]` + legacy dual selectors | Denali portal CSS migration plan |
| P1-04 | `app/me/page.tsx` or equivalent redirect for bare `/me` (DL-40) | Route handler |
| P1-05 | Portal SEO metadata plan approved (DL-39) — may land P1 or P3 | robots/metadata spec |

**Phase 1 must NOT:**

- Introduce member registry codegen
- Change `/me/registrations` URL
- Add catch-all dispatcher

