## 7. Rollback criteria

Rollback **per phase** — do not revert prior frozen URLs.

| Phase | Rollback trigger | Action |
| ----- | ---------------- | ------ |
| 1 | SMK-PTL-02..08 fail after shell merge | Revert shell PR; keep inline nav |
| 1 | Registration shows full shell bottom nav | Hotfix — violates DL-01 |
| 2 | Codegen breaks Urban/starter L3 builds | Disable L4 fail; warn only (DL-18) |
| 3 | Marketing nav 404 on club hosts | Revert manifest nav; restore hardcoded links temporarily |
| 3 | GSH URL breaks SMK-PTL-05 | Keep `/me/registrations` alias in resolver |
| 5 | Entitlements deny valid members | TTL=0 + bypass flag; disable nav gating |
| Any | `/me/registrations` URL removed or broken | **Stop ship** — violates URL freeze |

**Alias invariant:** `/me/registrations` must remain reachable after any rollback that keeps member shell shipped.

