## 8. Required green guards

Documentation targets — scripts may not exist until implementation phases.

| Guard | Phase required | Purpose |
| ----- | -------------- | ------- |
| `pnpm run guard:docs` | All | Doc-code covenant |
| `pnpm run guard:import-boundary` | All | Package boundaries |
| `pnpm run guard:wrs-routing` | 3+ | WRS egress patterns |
| `pnpm run guard:pcms-authority` | All | Marketing session authority |
| `pnpm run guard:architecture` | 2+ | Architecture truth |
| `guard-member-portal-registry` | 2+ | No hardcoded shell nav · registry codegen `--check` |
| `guard-member-url-builder` | 3+ | Builder Migration Contract |
| `guard-member-module-id-reserved` | 2+ | Platform-owned `home` (codegen in registry guard) |
| `guard-workspace-member-egress` | 4+ | Workspace href scan |
| `guard-member-seo` | 4+ | Portal noindex |
| `guard-guest-cross-surface-nav` | 4+ | DL-37 admission |
| `guard-public-catalog-m17` extension | 5+ | Entitlements/home BFF allowlist (DL-31) |
| `guard-member-shell` | 1+ | Shell landmarks + registration minimal mode |
| `pnpm run guard:member-portal-shell` | 1–6 | Meta — runs all guards above |
| Guest conformance L4 | 2 warn / 5 fail | `memberPortal` block (DL-18) |
| `pnpm run phase-6:guard` | Doc pack | Phase 6 doc integrity when touched |

**Fast-track before PR (recommended):** `pnpm run pre-commit:fast && pnpm run guard:import-boundary`

